   "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p>Prove that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tanh^{-1}(x)=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\right)\\qquad-k&lt;x&lt;k\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>stating the value of the constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>.</p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li><li><p>Hence, or otherwise, solve the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x=\\tanh\\left(\\ln\\sqrt{2-3x}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li></ol>",
